{"accountName": "奇安信CERT", "author": "奇安信CERT", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "奇安信 CERT 2026-10-22 00:24 江苏", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555uKkqw0coAJXFFsP4yKFibGO7NuZLWlaRMtwh1Yic2mG96Equu9mgFhFoqkBlibia6ia2DVGoh06hflW2WlLH11ej3LictnibZ8ZCcYQk/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞概述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞名称", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP 远程代码执行漏洞", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/RwAbCjh555u8MzqZLaXFbkCyWAiangrctiaiagzia4Qt59hqYGduOJpicdu7yQ3eTFCKT99bEWwOfxooRK768Jm94Jrtv85UoI7uZmkh66kOBlhQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619", "type": "p"}, {"text": "公开时间", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "图片", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555viaiaDvX8Ut3Ytsbhkqoia2nZS86w0T6trGosR06Rmj1YibIPrhYZVGOssp8L3iaCde9vzWxvcPUia6JAY7gJ7ML6aatr82uMFwwzlY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1&tp=webp#imgIndex=2", "type": "img"}, {"text": "2026-10-21", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响量级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "千万级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信评级", "type": "p"}, {"text": "高危", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVSS 3.1分数", "type": "p"}, {"text": "8.1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "威胁类型", "type": "p"}, {"text": "代码执行", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用可能性", "type": "p"}, {"text": "POC状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "在野利用状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "未发现", "type": "p"}, {"text": "EXP状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "技术细节状态", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已公开", "type": "p"}, {"text": "危害描述： 可导致无需认证的堆 UAF、内存泄露和远程代码执行，攻击者以 Web worker 权限执行任意命令，写入 WebShell、窃取凭据和业务数据、横向移动并植入持久化后门。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "0 1", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞详情", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP 是一种广泛使用的开源服务器端脚本语言，主要运行于 Web 服务器端，支持 Apache mod_php、PHP-FPM（配合 Nginx、Apache mod_proxy_fcgi）、FrankenPHP、LiteSpeed LSAPI 等多种部署方式。W3Techs 统计显示，全球约四分之三的网站使用 PHP 作为服务器端编程语言，WordPress、Drupal、Joomla、MediaWiki、Magento、phpMyAdmin、Nextcloud、Laravel、Symfony、WHMCS 等主流应用均依赖 PHP。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞描述", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用条件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "无需登录、无需用户交互、无需应用层漏洞；攻击面为可接收 HTTP 请求的 PHP 端点，包括静态站点中的简单 PHP 页面。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "02", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响范围", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "影响版本", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP < 8.2.35", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP < 8.3.36", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP < 8.4.27", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP < 8.5.12", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "其他受影响组件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "以 PHP 为运行时的应用、框架与建站系统可能间接受影响，涉及 WordPress、MediaWiki、phpBB、Magento、Laravel、Symfony、Drupal 等，以及 mod_php、PHP-FPM（含 Docker PHP-FPM 镜像）等部署形态。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "03", "type": "p"}, {"text": "复现情况", "type": "p"}, {"text": "目前， 奇安信CERT已成功复现 PHP 远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619) ，截图如下：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "04", "type": "p"}, {"text": "处置建议", "type": "p"}, {"text": "> > > >", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全更新", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP 8.5.12", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP 8.4.27", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP 8.3.36", "type": "p"}, {"text": "PHP 8.2.35", "type": "p"}, {"text": "下载地址：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "https://www.php.net/downloads.php", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1. 升级后必须重启 Apache、PHP-FPM 及所有常驻 worker，确保旧进程不再处理请求；仅替换二进制而不重启进程不能消除风险。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2. 容器环境应重新构建镜像，避免沿用包含旧 PHP 的 layer；Kubernetes 环境应滚动重启所有 Pod，并确认没有旧 ReplicaSet 继续服务。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "3. 发行版仓库（Ubuntu、Debian、RHEL、Alpine 等）和集成环境（宝塔、phpStudy、XAMPP、Docker 官方镜像等）可能存在同步延迟，请以 `php -v`、`php-fpm -v` 的实际输出为准，不要仅核对包管理器版本号。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "4. PHP 8.1 及更早版本已停止支持，官方不再提供补丁，建议迁移至 PHP 8.2 或更高版本；若使用发行版长期支持分支，请以厂商 backport 公告为准。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "5. 共享主机和虚拟主机用户应联系服务商确认 PHP 版本；多租户环境需确认所有租户实例均已升级。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "注意：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "不要使用 RLIMIT_AS 或 RLIMIT_DATA 作为缓解措施。这些限制会导致 mmap() 失败，从而触发 CVE-2026-109618 所依赖的 longjmp() 路径。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "05", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[1] https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[2] https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-6wmf-4rv5-p3rp", "type": "p"}, {"text": "[3] https://calif.io/php2shell/#writeup", "type": "p"}, {"text": "06", "type": "p"}, {"text": "时间线", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年10月21日， 漏洞公开披露：CVE 信息已公开，可据此核对受影响产品与版本并启动修复。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2026年10月22日，奇安信 CERT已复现该漏洞， 发布安全风险通告。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "07", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞情报服务", "type": "p"}, {"text": "「 奇安信漏洞情报平台 」 重磅上线，诚邀您来体验：", "type": "p"}, {"text": "奇安信 CERT", "type": "p"}, {"text": "致力于 第一时间为企业级用户提供 权威 漏洞情报和 有效 解决方案。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点击↓ 阅读原文 ，到 ALPHA威胁分析平台 订阅更多漏洞信息。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/RwAbCjh555uKkqw0coAJXFFsP4yKFibGO7NuZLWlaRMtwh1Yic2mG96Equu9mgFhFoqkBlibia6ia2DVGoh06hflW2WlLH11ej3LictnibZ8ZCcYQk/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "date": "10月21日", "id": "1358429478", "summary": "奇安信 CERT 2026-10-22 00:24 江苏 \n致力于第一时间为企业级用户提供权威漏洞情报和有效解决方案。\n●  点击↑蓝字关注我们，获取更多安全风险通告 \n漏洞概述 \n漏洞名称 \nPHP 远程代码执行漏洞 \n漏洞编号 \nCVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619 \n公开时间 \n2026-10-21 \n影响量级 \n千万级 \n奇安信评级 \n高危 \nCVSS 3.1分数", "title": "【已复现可RCE】PHP 远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619)安全风险通告", "ts": 1792599840000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247507882&idx=1&sn=55fdfe59d564f4ff9df5069d0254761e"}